                SELECT
                    seq_id as sno,
                    c001 as customer_id,
                    c002 as contact_name,
                    c003 as contact_email,
                    c004 as customer_name,
                    c005 as industry_name,
                    ' ' as  delete_acc
                FROM
                  apex_collections
                WHERE collection_name = 'P523_ACCOUNT_COLLECTION'  
                order by seq_id, c005, c004
                ```
